msgstr "ドアの前まで歩いて、Eキーを押します。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_game_room.html.heex:24
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_office.html.heex:27
